    comment "en" """
        Source E701W SNOMED CT 68528007 is the Swedish residual bucket under WHO ICD-10 E70.1. Athena maps
        E70.1 -> SNOMED CT 4287416 (concept_code 68528007), which legitimately subsumes every
        BH4-metabolism defect in this residual category (DHPR deficiency and BH4 synthesis defect are
        the named siblings E701A/B and have their own exact maps; this W-code catches the rest). high:
        crosswalk-verified one-level broader ancestor covering a heterogeneous residual.
        """
}
